# No arrastrar artefactos locales al contexto de build (acelera y evita node_modules locales)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
.git
.github

# env files (se inyectan por build-arg / runtime), salvo plantillas
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# terraform
infra/terraform/.terraform
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/.terraform.lock.hcl

# misc
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
*.tsbuildinfo
